todo keeps a list of things to do.

It is a nova demo application: nothing is persisted, every command
prints what it would have done.

Usage:
  todo [command]

Examples:
  todo add buy milk
  todo list --all
  todo done 2 --by alice

Available Commands:
  add         Add a todo item
  completion  Generate the autocompletion script for the specified shell
  config      Manage configuration
  done        Mark a todo item done
  help        Help about any command
  list        List todo items

Flags:
  -h, --help      help for todo
  -v, --verbose   verbose output
      --version   version for todo

Use "todo [command] --help" for more information about a command.
